  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Capacity of CSOs in the field of Climate Change and Biodiversity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Capacity of CSOs in the field of Climate Change and Biodiversity Project is to increase the capacities of civil society organisations to support the achievement of the ambitious targets of the net-zero and nature positive climate action. The specific objective of this action is to design and operate a technical assistance and grant mechanism in the form of a CSO Grant Programme, including capacity assessments, strategy and priority setting, trainings and launching of a call for propos</narrative>
